      "funding_type": "fee waiver",
      "typical_award_size": "Chapter 21.03 amendments (Ordinance 1052) were heard December 13, 2022, continued, and approved January 17, 2023 with Resolution 2023-02 adopting a $30 per square foot inclusionary in-lieu fee for for-sale homes (fractional units and 6 to 10 unit projects). The amended Section 21.03.012 allows in-lieu fees to fund an affordable housing trust or to reimburse the County for impact fee waivers granted to 100% affordable developments. The Board directed staff to return in three months to revisit the 15% floor and the in-lieu fee. Fund balance and any waiver approvals are not published. Before 2023, developers voluntarily paid $4,500 per unit under development agreements.",
